WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.330 --> 00:00:02.430
- Here's how I made $1 million this year

00:00:02.430 --> 00:00:04.230
as a solo serial entrepreneur

00:00:04.230 --> 00:00:05.790
I wake up at 5:00 a.m. every day.

00:00:05.790 --> 00:00:07.140
I meditate for 30 minutes.

00:00:07.140 --> 00:00:08.280
I journal for 10 minutes.

00:00:08.280 --> 00:00:10.200
I practice gratitude for five minutes.

00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:11.130
I love you!

00:00:11.130 --> 00:00:13.590
I do my daily jog while
listening to Naval's podcast

00:00:13.590 --> 00:00:14.520
on how to get rich.

00:00:14.520 --> 00:00:16.920
I sign up for a drop
shipping VIP masterclass.

00:00:16.920 --> 00:00:18.540
I get on a call with my mentor.

00:00:18.540 --> 00:00:20.850
- Like, I got my entire fist in there.

00:00:20.850 --> 00:00:22.200
It was crazy.

00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:23.310
Sorry, what was your question?

00:00:23.310 --> 00:00:25.560
- I work 60 hours a week
in social media marketing.

00:00:25.560 --> 00:00:27.240
I invest that money into crypto.

00:00:27.240 --> 00:00:29.100
I run a dropshipping
business selling socks.

00:00:29.100 --> 00:00:30.720
I write a personal finance newsletter

00:00:30.720 --> 00:00:31.740
with affiliate marketing.

00:00:31.740 --> 00:00:33.780
I sell a course called how
I make 1 million a year

00:00:33.780 --> 00:00:34.613
in your 20s.

00:00:34.613 --> 00:00:36.720
I do consulting calls for $500 an hour.

00:00:36.720 --> 00:00:38.520
I bought three properties
and I flipped them

00:00:38.520 --> 00:00:42.390
and my dad gifted me $1
million for my birthday.

00:00:42.390 --> 00:00:46.173
And that's how you make 1
million a year in your 20s.

00:00:47.104 --> 00:00:48.324
(microphone clattering)

